    "id": "pose_07_running",
    "name": "Running, left knee driving forward",
    "description": "Running stride. Right foot behind on the ball of the foot pushing off; left knee driven forward and up with the lower leg folded back. Torso leans forward; elbows bent about 90 degrees with the right arm forward and the left arm back, hands in loose fists. Left/right are the character's own.",
    "targetModels": [
      "female",
      "male"
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Shown in the support phase (right ball on the floor) rather than the flight phase, so the lowest point is on the floor.",
      "Authored on rig/female.glb; the male uses the same rotations and the hips-height-relative root offset. The root height is the mean of the female and male heights that put the contact on y = 0, so both models land within a few millimetres of the floor."
    ],
    "generator": "/tmp/pose-author/build_all.py + p0N.py (poser authoring scripts, kept outside the repository)"
  },
